# Pulse — main endpoints. Generated skeleton, synthetic data only.
# Path ids below are placeholders — replace with real ids from a list call.
@id = 1
# Variables: see rest/http-client.env.json (host, session, xsrf). How to get them: docs/guides/api.md
# Full list of Pulse operations: /api/docs (tag "Pulse").

### GET /api/pulse/my/waves — pulse.my.waves
GET {{host}}/api/pulse/my/waves
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}

### GET /api/pulse/waves/{id}/form — pulse.waves.form
GET {{host}}/api/pulse/waves/{{id}}/form
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}

### POST /api/pulse/waves/{id}/responses — pulse.waves.respond
POST {{host}}/api/pulse/waves/{{id}}/responses
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Referer: {{host}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "answers": {
        "enps": 9,
        "why": "Example comment"
    }
}

### GET /api/pulse/waves/{id}/results — pulse.waves.results
GET {{host}}/api/pulse/waves/{{id}}/results
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}

### GET /api/pulse/waves/{id}/compare — pulse.waves.compare
GET {{host}}/api/pulse/waves/{{id}}/compare
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}

